OL,3,GNEWSACouple complete 95-mile
OL,4,A'pensioners' pilgrimage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired couple have completed a
OL,7,F95-mile (153km) charity walk for their
OL,8,Fsecond so-called "Pensioners'
OL,9,FPilgrimage".
OL,11,FNick and Kerstin Banham from Daventry,
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, spent ten days
OL,13,Ftrekking from their home to London,
OL,14,Ffollowing the Grand Union Canal
OL,15,Ftowpath.
OL,17,FThe couple, aged 84 and 74
OL,18,Frespectively, called it their second
OL,19,F"pensioners' pilgrimage", having
OL,20,Fcompleted a challenge using their free
OL,21,Fbus passes in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
