OL,3,GNEWSACouple complete 95-mile
OL,4,A'pensioners' pilgrimage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKerstin Banham said: "We knew we
OL,7,Fcouldn't run a marathon or climb a
OL,8,Fmountain, but we still wanted to do
OL,9,Fsomething that would challenge us."
